{%- comment -%}
  Carrier transit evidence by destination: the ONE place these numbers live.
  Source: BuckyDrop public fee calculator, read 2026-11-26 (see
  ops/category-team/state/transit-evidence-2026-11-26.md). Line used: YunExpress clothing registered
  air mail (US, CA, GB, DE, FR, IT, ES, NL, SE); YunExpress Air Cargo (General) where no clothing line
  was listed (CZ, PL). Values are carrier transit days, "min-max".
  A country NOT in this map has no evidence: pages show no dated estimate and the structured data
  carries no delivery time for it. Add a country only with a dated evidence line.

  Usage: {%- capture tm -%}{% render 'dlm-transit-map', country: localization.country.iso_code %}{%- endcapture -%}
  Prints e.g. "14-21", or nothing for a country without evidence.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign dtm_map = 'US:7-14|CA:14-24|GB:7-14|DE:14-21|FR:14-21|IT:14-21|ES:14-21|CZ:14-21|NL:12-17|PL:14-21|SE:12-17'
  assign dtm_iso = country | append: '' | strip | upcase
  assign dtm_entries = dtm_map | split: '|'
  for dtm_entry in dtm_entries
    assign dtm_pair = dtm_entry | split: ':'
    if dtm_pair[0] == dtm_iso
      echo dtm_pair[1]
      break
    endif
  endfor
-%}
